Ported from the TypeScript build's __tests__/cases/typescript/009-directory-with-glob.case.yaml; expected output is the TypeScript build's.
Its source-code inputs were rewritten as Markdown files.
Except: the glob view says "a header or summary" instead of "header comments" (docs/changelog.md).
